00:02:16.599 --> 00:02:20.682
(audience laughing and clapping)

00:02:23.182 --> 00:02:25.034
(whistles)

00:02:25.034 --> 00:02:26.118
(audience laughing)

00:02:26.118 --> 00:02:27.690
I mean, air-sea rescue.

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:29.960
Now I don't know if you've
ever been in a helicopter,

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.275
of course you haven't, right?

00:02:31.275 --> 00:02:32.307
But...

00:02:32.307 --> 00:02:33.140
(audience laughing)

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:35.310
