00:02:46.724 --> 00:02:49.832
(imitating muffled rattling noise)

00:02:49.832 --> 00:02:52.581
(audience laughing)

00:02:52.581 --> 00:02:53.500
(whistles)

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.513
(audience laughing)

00:02:55.513 --> 00:02:57.792
Never gonna happen,
it's never gonna happen.

00:02:57.792 --> 00:03:00.792
(audience laughing)

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:02.540
(Ricky chuckles)

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:05.026
If you crash, you die, right?

00:03:05.026 --> 00:03:08.026
